-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ט/2: הסכם בענין הרפורמות במכללות להכשרת עובדי הוראה — מתוקן
-- The collective agreement of 21.1.2019 for teachers in the teacher-
-- training colleges: promotion grades replaced by academic ranks, a
-- trailing promotion supplement, a shekel supplement by rank, the 2015 and
-- 2018 one-time grants, the reform-implementation grant on leaving, and
-- the jubilee grant at 25 years.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in salary months from September
-- 2018 (= 1): January 2019 is 5, February 6, May 9, June 10, July 11.

§ `חוזר תשע"ט/2 הרפורמות במכללות`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, subject, the recital of the agreement of 21.1.2019 and of the colleges' reform agreement of 7.5.2015, and the circular's purpose; no rule.

§§ `1 הוראות כלליות`

-- akn:art_1__para_a akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_1__para_c akn:art_1__para_d Rules of interpretation (the preamble is part of the agreement; gender and number; headings are for convenience); no rule to encode.

§§ `2–4 תחולה, תחילה, הגדרות`

-- §4: the two kinds of college teacher, by whether on the eve of the
-- agreement he was entitled to, and paid, a promotion grade under the
-- agreements of 22.5.1997 (as amended 30.12.1997 and 18.12.2001).
@ref akn:art_4/p1 akn:art_4/p2
DECLARE `kind of college teacher` IS ONE OF
    `a teacher who had a promotion grade`
    `a teacher who had no promotion grade`

@desc A teacher in a teacher-training college, as far as this circular asks.
DECLARE `college teacher` HAS
    `covered by the colleges' reform agreement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc of 7.5.2015
    `kind` IS A `kind of college teacher`
    `promotion grade rate on the eve` IS A NUMBER @desc the rate of the promotion-grade supplement paid on the eve of the agreement, as a fraction; 0 if none

@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN t IS A `college teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement applies to` t IF
    t's `covered by the colleges' reform agreement`

@ref akn:art_3/p1
`the determining date` MEANS Date 1 9 2018

§§ `5 מבנה השכר וההעסקה`

-- akn:art_5/p1 The recital of why the structure of pay and employment changes; no rule.

-- §5(a)(1)-(2): from the determining date the promotion-grade agreements
-- are void: no promotion on their scale and no supplements tied to it;
-- promotion is by academic rank only.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the promotion-grade agreements govern on` `the day` IF
    `the day` LESS THAN `the determining date`

-- §5(a)(3): the trailing promotion supplement, at the eve's rate, on the
-- combined salary and the supplements named.
@desc The pay components the trailing promotion supplement is computed on.
DECLARE `trailing base` HAS
    `combined salary`                IS A NUMBER
    `teaching agreement supplement`  IS A NUMBER
    `94 supplement`                  IS A NUMBER
    `2001 supplement`                IS A NUMBER
    `2008 supplement`                IS A NUMBER
    `2011 supplement`                IS A NUMBER
    `reform supplement`              IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN t IS A `college teacher`, b IS A `trailing base`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the trailing promotion supplement` t b `the day` IS
    IF t's `kind` EQUALS `a teacher who had a promotion grade` AND `the day` AT LEAST `the determining date`
    THEN t's `promotion grade rate on the eve`
         TIMES (b's `combined salary`
                PLUS b's `teaching agreement supplement`
                PLUS b's `94 supplement`
                PLUS b's `2001 supplement`
                PLUS b's `2008 supplement`
                PLUS b's `2011 supplement`
                PLUS b's `reform supplement`)
    ELSE 0

-- §5(a)(4)-(6) and §5(d)(5)-(7): salary for every matter, counted for the
-- hourly value, severance pay, pension deposits (accruing pension) and the
-- study fund; not in the base of any other supplement, except annual
-- supplements and grants computed on the overtime hourly base or the
-- budgetary-pension determining salary. Both new supplements alike.
DECLARE `purpose` IS ONE OF
    `salary for every matter`
    `the hourly value`
    `severance pay`
    `accruing-pension deposits`
    `study-fund deposits`
    `the base of another supplement`
    `annual supplements and grants on the overtime or budgetary-pension base`

@ref akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_5 akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_6 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_5 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_6 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_7
GIVEN u IS A `purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the new supplements count for` u IF
    NOT u EQUALS `the base of another supplement`

DECLARE `college action` IS ONE OF
    `act for recognition as a permanent supplement under the State Service (Pensions) Law`
    `implement the agreement in the salary` HAS `arrears since 1.9.2018 paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the 2015 grant` HAS `grant 2015 paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the 2018 grant` HAS `grant 2018 paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the special grant` HAS `special grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the jubilee differences` HAS `jubilee differences paid` IS A NUMBER

-- §5(a)(7), §5(d)(8): the State undertakes to act for the recognition of
-- both supplements as permanent supplements (no deadline is given).
@ref akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_7 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_8
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `college action`
DECIDE `the State's undertaking` IS
    PARTY `the Treasury`
    MUST  `act for recognition as a permanent supplement under the State Service (Pensions) Law`

-- §5(b): the academic ranks.
@ref akn:art_5__para_b akn:art_5__para_b/p2 akn:art_5__para_b/p3 akn:art_5__para_b/p4 akn:art_5__para_b/p5 akn:art_5__para_b/p6
DECLARE `academic rank` IS ONE OF
    `lecturer`
    `adjunct lecturer`
    `senior lecturer`
    `adjunct senior lecturer`
    `associate professor`
    `adjunct associate professor`
    `full professor`

@desc A college teacher's employment as the rank conditions of section 5(c) ask about it.
DECLARE `rank candidacy` HAS
    `tenured`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `tenured position at the college` IS A NUMBER @desc fixed (tenured) position at that college, 1 = full; set as is customary today (section 5(c)(6))
    `position in academic tracks`     IS A NUMBER
    `years actually employed at the college` IS A NUMBER
    `approved under the management rules` IS A BOOLEAN @desc by the college's appointments committee, or for professorships the CHE's top committee on the college's recommendation; an input

-- §5(c)(1)-(2): who grants the ranks is the CHE's management rules, applied
-- by the college's appointments regulations; an input here.
-- §5(c)(3)-(5): the position each rank requires at that college.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_3 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_4 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_5 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_6
GIVEN r IS AN `academic rank`, c IS A `rank candidacy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the position condition for` r c IF
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `lecturer`                    THEN c's `tenured position at the college` AT LEAST 0.6 AND c's `position in academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.5
    WHEN `adjunct lecturer`            THEN c's `tenured position at the college` AT LEAST 0.6 AND c's `position in academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.5
    WHEN `senior lecturer`             THEN c's `tenured position at the college` AT LEAST 0.65 AND c's `position in academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.5
    WHEN `adjunct senior lecturer`     THEN c's `tenured position at the college` AT LEAST 0.65 AND c's `position in academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.5
    OTHERWISE c's `tenured position at the college` AT LEAST 1 AND c's `position in academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.75

-- §5(c)(8): a tenured teacher meeting the conditions may apply.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_8
GIVEN r IS AN `academic rank`, c IS A `rank candidacy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may apply for` r c IF
    c's `tenured` AND `meets the position condition for` r c

@ref akn:art_5__para_c akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_1__cls_1 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_1__cls_2 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_1__cls_3 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_1__cls_4 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_1__cls_4/p2 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_1__cls_4/p3 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_8
GIVEN r IS AN `academic rank`, c IS A `rank candidacy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is entitled to the rank` r c IF
    c's `approved under the management rules` AND `meets the position condition for` r c

GIVEN x IS A `rank candidacy`, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the temporary senior rule holds` x y IF
        y AT LEAST 2018 AND y AT MOST 2020
    AND x's `tenured`
    AND x's `years actually employed at the college` AT LEAST 6
    AND x's `tenured position at the college` AT LEAST 0.65
    AND x's `position in academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.5

GIVEN x IS A `rank candidacy`, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the temporary professor rule holds` x y IF
        y AT LEAST 2018 AND y AT MOST 2022
    AND x's `tenured`
    AND x's `years actually employed at the college` AT LEAST 6
    AND x's `position in academic tracks` AT LEAST 1

-- §5(c)(1)(4) third and fourth paragraphs: the appointment regulations
-- must carry a temporary rule — in 2018-2020 a tenured teacher actually
-- employed six years at 65% or more, 50% academic, is exempt from the
-- minimum time as lecturer for senior lecturer. §5(c)(2) second paragraph:
-- in 2018-2022, six years at 100% academic exempts from it for the
-- professorships' recommendation.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_1__cls_4/p3 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_1__cls_4/p4 akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_2/p2
GIVEN r IS AN `academic rank`, c IS A `rank candidacy`, `calendar year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is exempt from the minimum time as lecturer` r c `calendar year` IF
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `senior lecturer` THEN `the temporary senior rule holds` c `calendar year`
    WHEN `adjunct senior lecturer` THEN `the temporary senior rule holds` c `calendar year`
    WHEN `associate professor` THEN `the temporary professor rule holds` c `calendar year`
    WHEN `adjunct associate professor` THEN `the temporary professor rule holds` c `calendar year`
    WHEN `full professor` THEN `the temporary professor rule holds` c `calendar year`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- §5(c)(7): the rank runs from the later of 1 September of the school year
-- it was approved in, and the 1st of the month after the application.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_7
GIVEN `1 September of the year of approval` IS A DATE, `first of the month after the application` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the rank's entitlement date` `1 September of the year of approval` `first of the month after the application` IS
    IF `1 September of the year of approval` AT LEAST `first of the month after the application`
    THEN `1 September of the year of approval`
    ELSE `first of the month after the application`

-- §5(c)(8), second sentence, and §5(d)(9) second paragraph: a rank approved
-- before the agreement counts from the determining date only once the
-- position conditions are met; until then no shekel supplement.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c__subpara_8 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_9 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_9/p2
GIVEN r IS AN `academic rank`, c IS A `rank candidacy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an earlier rank earns the shekel supplement` r c IF
    `meets the position condition for` r c

-- §5(d)(1) and §5(e)(1): the amount for the calculation — for a teacher
-- without a promotion grade, the trailing management or counselling
-- stipend; for one with it, that plus the trailing promotion supplement —
-- at each check date: the eve of the rank, a change in seniority or
-- education, and each update of the colleges' salary tables.
DECLARE `check date` IS ONE OF
    `the eve of receiving the rank`
    `a change in seniority or academic education`
    `an update of the colleges' salary tables`

@ref akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_1__cls_1 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_1__cls_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_1__cls_3 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_1 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_1/p2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_1__pnt_1 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_1__pnt_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_1__hc_1/p1 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_1__hc_1__pnt_1 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_1__hc_1__pnt_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_1__hc_1__pnt_3
GIVEN t IS A `college teacher`
      `trailing management or counselling stipend` IS A NUMBER @desc paid at the check date
      `trailing promotion supplement paid` IS A NUMBER @desc paid at the check date
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the amount for the calculation` t `trailing management or counselling stipend` `trailing promotion supplement paid` IS
    IF t's `kind` EQUALS `a teacher who had a promotion grade`
    THEN `trailing management or counselling stipend` PLUS `trailing promotion supplement paid`
    ELSE `trailing management or counselling stipend`

-- §5(d)(2)(a)-(d) and §5(e)(3)-(6): for a full position, the higher of
-- (the first figure less the amount for the calculation) and the floor.
@ref akn:art_5__para_d akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_a akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_a/p2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_a__pnt_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_b akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_b__pnt_1 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_b__pnt_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_c akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_c__pnt_1 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_c__pnt_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_1 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_3 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_3__pnt_a akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_3__pnt_a/p2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_3__pnt_b akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_4 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_4__pnt_a akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_4__pnt_b akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_5 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_5__pnt_a akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_5__pnt_b akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_6 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_6__pnt_a akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_6__pnt_b
GIVEN r IS AN `academic rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the first figure` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `lecturer`                    THEN 800
    WHEN `adjunct lecturer`            THEN 800
    WHEN `senior lecturer`             THEN 1000
    WHEN `adjunct senior lecturer`     THEN 1000
    WHEN `associate professor`         THEN 1450
    WHEN `adjunct associate professor` THEN 1450
    WHEN `full professor`              THEN 2100

@ref akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_a__pnt_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_b__pnt_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_c__pnt_2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_2
GIVEN r IS AN `academic rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the floor` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `lecturer`         THEN 300
    WHEN `adjunct lecturer` THEN 300
    OTHERWISE 400

-- §5(d)(4), §5(e)(7): from January 2019, each January, the figures rise by
-- the index (December before against the December of the last update; for
-- the first, December 2017); a fall is not applied but carried until an
-- update can absorb it.
@ref akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_4 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_4/p2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_4/p3 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_4/p4 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_4/p5 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_4/p6 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_7
GIVEN `the new index` IS A NUMBER, `the index of the last update` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the January update factor` `the new index` `the index of the last update` IS
    IF `the new index` GREATER THAN `the index of the last update`
    THEN `the new index` DIVIDED BY `the index of the last update`
    ELSE 1

-- §5(d)(2)(a)-(d), §5(e)(3)-(6), with the figures updated by the factor
-- since 2019; §5(d)(3) and §5(e)(8): a part position in proportion, nothing
-- above a full position; the test is made at each check date and governs
-- until the next (§5(d)(2)(a) and §5(e)(3), last paragraphs).
@export default The monthly shekel supplement by academic rank of a teacher in a teacher-training college under the owners' circular 5779/2
@ref akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_a__pnt_2/p2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_a__pnt_2/p3 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_a__pnt_2/p4 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_a__pnt_2/p5 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_a__pnt_2/p6 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_3__pnt_b/p2 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_3__pnt_b/p3 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_3__pnt_b/p4 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_3__pnt_b/p5 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_3__pnt_b/p6 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_d__pnt_3 akn:art_5__para_d__subpara_2__cls_e__pnt_8
GIVEN r IS AN `academic rank` @desc the rank the teacher is entitled to
      `amount for the calculation` IS A NUMBER @desc at the last check date, in shekels
      `update factor` IS A NUMBER @desc the cumulative January index updates since 2019; 1 before any
      `position at the college` IS A NUMBER @desc 1 = a full position
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the shekel supplement by rank` r `amount for the calculation` `update factor` `position at the college` IS
    max (`the first figure` r TIMES `update factor` MINUS `amount for the calculation`)
        (`the floor` r TIMES `update factor`)
    TIMES min `position at the college` 1

§§ `6 ביצוע`

-- §6: the payments under §5(a)(3), §5(d) and §5(e), and the cancellation
-- under §5(a)(1), from the June 2019 salary (10), no later than July's
-- (11), with the differences since 1.9.2018.
@ref akn:art_6/p1 akn:art_6/p2
GIVEN `arrears owed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `college action`
DECIDE `carrying out the agreement` `arrears owed` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `implement the agreement in the salary` `paid`
          PROVIDED `paid` AT LEAST `arrears owed`
    WITHIN 11
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 6: no later than the salary for July 2019, with the differences since 1.9.2018"

-- ¶3 heads the two grants: 13,000 shekels in all.
@ref akn:art_6/p3
`the two one-time grants together` MEANS 13000

§§ `7–8 מענקים חד פעמיים`

DECLARE `kind of grant month` IS ONE OF
    `worked`
    `maternity and parenthood, reserve duty or unpaid sick leave`
    `unpaid leave, sabbatical or leave treated as unpaid`
    `not employed`

@desc One month of a grant period: the position held (for a month wholly in maternity, reserve or unpaid sick leave, the position on its eve) and what the month was.
DECLARE `grant month` HAS
    `position that month` IS A NUMBER
    `kind of month` IS A `kind of grant month`

-- §7(e)-(g): unpaid leave, sabbatical and leave treated as unpaid (also
-- after maternity leave ends) are not counted; reserve duty, maternity and
-- parenthood, and unpaid sick leave are, at the eve's position (§7(f)).
@ref akn:art_7__para_e akn:art_7__para_e/p2 akn:art_7__para_f akn:art_7__para_g
GIVEN m IS A `grant month`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the month counts` m IF
    CONSIDER m's `kind of month`
    WHEN `worked` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `maternity and parenthood, reserve duty or unpaid sick leave` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- §7(c), (d), (f): never above 100% in a month.
@ref akn:art_7__para_c akn:art_7__para_d akn:art_7__para_f/p2
GIVEN m IS A `grant month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the month's position` m IS
    IF `the month counts` m THEN min (m's `position that month`) 1 ELSE 0

-- §7(a)-(d): the grant in proportion to the months counted and the
-- (weighted) position, if at least the minimum months were counted (10 for
-- the 2015 grant; 12 for the 2018 grant, §8(b)). A full position all the
-- period gets it whole.
@ref akn:art_7__para_a akn:art_7__para_b akn:art_7__para_c akn:art_7__para_d akn:art_8__para_a akn:art_8__para_b
GIVEN `full grant` IS A NUMBER
      `months in the period` IS A NUMBER
      `minimum months` IS A NUMBER
      `months` IS A LIST OF `grant month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a one-time grant` `full grant` `months in the period` `minimum months` `months` IS
    IF count (filter `the month counts` `months`) AT LEAST `minimum months`
    THEN `full grant` TIMES sum (map `the month's position` `months`) DIVIDED BY `months in the period`
    ELSE 0

-- The 2015 grant: 1.9.2013-31.8.2015 (24 months), 5,000 shekels, at least
-- 10 months.
@ref akn:art_7__para_a akn:art_7__para_b akn:art_7__para_d
GIVEN `months` IS A LIST OF `grant month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2015 grant` `months` IS `a one-time grant` 5000 24 10 `months`

-- The 2018 grant: 1.9.2015-30.6.2018 (34 months), 8,000 shekels, at least
-- 12 months.
@ref akn:art_8__para_a akn:art_8__para_b
GIVEN `months` IS A LIST OF `grant month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2018 grant` `months` IS `a one-time grant` 8000 34 12 `months`

-- §7(h)-(j), with §8(b): not salary, not for the hourly value of
-- substitution hours or absence deductions, severance, any provident
-- deposit, minimum-wage top-up, or the salary base.
@ref akn:art_7__para_h akn:art_7__para_i akn:art_7__para_j
GIVEN u IS A `purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the one-time grants count for` u IF FALSE

-- §7(a): the 2015 grant with the January 2019 salary (5), no later than
-- February's (6).
@ref akn:art_7__para_a/p2
GIVEN `months` IS A LIST OF `grant month`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `college action`
DECIDE `paying the 2015 grant` `months` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the 2015 grant` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the 2015 grant` `months`
    WITHIN 6
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 7a: the 2015 grant no later than the salary for February 2019"

-- §8(a): the 2018 grant with the May 2019 salary (9), "no later than the
-- June 2018 salary paid in July 2019" — read as June 2019's (10), the
-- salary paid in July 2019.
@ref akn:art_8__para_a
GIVEN `months` IS A LIST OF `grant month`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `college action`
DECIDE `paying the 2018 grant` `months` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the 2018 grant` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the 2018 grant` `months`
    WITHIN 10
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 8a: the 2018 grant no later than the salary paid in July 2019"

§§ `9 מענק יישום רפורמה במכללות`

@desc A teacher whose employment at a college ended, as section 9 asks.
DECLARE `leaver` HAS
    `employment ended on or after 31.8.2015` IS A BOOLEAN
    `ended because of the colleges' organisational changes` IS A BOOLEAN @desc not, e.g., for pedagogical reasons (section 9(g))
    `continuous years teaching in the colleges` IS A NUMBER
    `entitled to or received Civil Service Commission retirement terms` IS A BOOLEAN @desc now or on an earlier retirement from the civil service
    `age in months at the end of employment` IS A NUMBER
    `weighted position` IS A NUMBER
    `grant under section 22 of the State Service (Pensions) Law` IS A NUMBER @desc 0 if none

@ref akn:art_9__para_a akn:art_9__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_9__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_9__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_9__para_a__subpara_3/p2 akn:art_9__para_f akn:art_9__para_g akn:art_9__para_h
GIVEN l IS A `leaver`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a teacher who ended employment at a college` l IF
        l's `employment ended on or after 31.8.2015`
    AND l's `ended because of the colleges' organisational changes`
    AND l's `continuous years teaching in the colleges` AT LEAST 10
    AND NOT l's `entitled to or received Civil Service Commission retirement terms`

@desc A printed row of section 9(b)'s table: the age band (in months) and the special grant.
DECLARE `age band` HAS
    `from age in months` IS A NUMBER
    `to age in months`   IS A NUMBER
    `special grant`      IS A NUMBER

-- The last row prints "64" to "65" without the "and 11 months" the others
-- carry; read as up to 65 years and 0 months (F-2018-19_tashat_02-a).
@ref akn:art_9__para_b akn:art_9__para_b/p2 akn:art_9__para_b/p3 akn:art_9__para_b/p4 akn:art_9__para_b/p5 akn:art_9__para_b/p6 akn:art_9__para_b/p7 akn:art_9__para_b/p8
`the special grant table` MEANS
    LIST `age band` 600 659 200000,
         `age band` 660 719 120000,
         `age band` 720 767 80000,
         `age band` 768 780 35000

GIVEN `age in months` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the table's special grant` `age in months` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `special grant`)
             (filter (GIVEN b YIELD `age in months` AT LEAST b's `from age in months` AND `age in months` AT MOST b's `to age in months`)
                     `the special grant table`))

-- §9(c): in proportion to the weighted position, up to 100%. §9(d): one
-- entitled to the section 22 grant gets only the positive difference.
@export The special reform-implementation grant of a teacher whose employment at a teacher-training college ended through the reform, under the owners' circular 5779/2
@ref akn:art_9__para_c akn:art_9__para_d
GIVEN l IS A `leaver` @desc the teacher who left
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special grant` l IS
    IF `is a teacher who ended employment at a college` l
    THEN max 0 (`the table's special grant` (l's `age in months at the end of employment`)
                TIMES min (l's `weighted position`) 1
                MINUS l's `grant under section 22 of the State Service (Pensions) Law`)
    ELSE 0

-- §9(e): paid on leaving; to those who left before the agreement, by May
-- 2019 (9), at the latest June (10).
@ref akn:art_9__para_e
GIVEN l IS A `leaver`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `college action`
DECIDE `paying the special grant to an earlier leaver` l IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the special grant` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the special grant` l
    WITHIN 10
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 9e: by June 2019 at the latest"

§§ `10 מענק יובל`

-- §10: from the June 2016 salary (the jubilee grant for תשע"ו) the
-- seniority for the jubilee grant (section 11 of the agreement of
-- 19.9.1994) is 25 years, not 30; its other rules are unchanged; the
-- differences are paid in the May 2019 salary (9), at the latest June's (10).
@ref akn:art_10/p1
GIVEN `paid with the salary of` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee seniority in the colleges` `paid with the salary of` IS
    IF `paid with the salary of` AT LEAST Date 1 6 2016 THEN 25 ELSE 30

@ref akn:art_10/p2
GIVEN `differences owed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `college action`
DECIDE `paying the jubilee differences` `differences owed` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the jubilee differences` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `differences owed`
    WITHIN 10
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 10: the differences by the June 2019 salary at the latest"

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and the copies list; no rule.

-- Findings.

-- F-2018-19_tashat_02-a: at 65 years and 6 months the table's last row
-- gives 35,000 if "עד גיל 65" runs, like the rows above it, to 65 and 11
-- months, and nothing if it ends at 65.
`the last row read to 65 and 11 months` MEANS `age band` 768 791 35000
`the two readings of "up to 65" differ at 65 and a half` MEANS
        `the table's special grant` 786 EQUALS 0
    AND 786 AT MOST `the last row read to 65 and 11 months`'s `to age in months`
#ASSERT `the two readings of "up to 65" differ at 65 and a half`

-- Examples. Salary figures are placeholders.
#ASSERT `the shekel supplement by rank` `lecturer` 0 1 1 EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `the shekel supplement by rank` `lecturer` 650 1 1 EQUALS 300
#ASSERT `the shekel supplement by rank` `full professor` 500 1 0.5 EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `the January update factor` 99 100 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the two one-time grants together` EQUALS 5000 PLUS 8000

`twenty-four full months` MEANS replicate 24 (`grant month` 1 `worked`)
#ASSERT `the 2015 grant` `twenty-four full months` EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `the 2015 grant` (replicate 9 (`grant month` 1 `worked`)) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the 2015 grant` (replicate 12 (`grant month` 0.5 `worked`)) EQUALS 1250

`a 56-year-old leaver on 80%` MEANS `leaver` WITH
    `employment ended on or after 31.8.2015` IS TRUE
    `ended because of the colleges' organisational changes` IS TRUE
    `continuous years teaching in the colleges` IS 20
    `entitled to or received Civil Service Commission retirement terms` IS FALSE
    `age in months at the end of employment` IS 675
    `weighted position` IS 0.8
    `grant under section 22 of the State Service (Pensions) Law` IS 0
#ASSERT `the special grant` `a 56-year-old leaver on 80%` EQUALS 96000

#TRACE `paying the 2015 grant` `twenty-four full months` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the 2015 grant` 5000 AT 5
